# NOTE: runtime data IS tracked on purpose.
# data/ holds the radar's real work products: collected items, scored offers,
# digests, verification reports, run records, the raw You.com MCP research
# results and run logs. The upstream project ignored these; this fork keeps
# them so every result in the docs can be traced back to its raw evidence.

# Secrets / local config overrides
# (secrets.env itself is tracked deliberately - see AGENTS.md section 10)
.env
.env.*
secrets.json
cookies.json
config.local.yaml

